lan_routes.description:
Each route is reachable as `/t/<slug>/` on your friendly domain after you sign in at vome.io.

{routes_summary}

Tip: devices that generate absolute URLs (or ignore a reverse-proxy base path) may need their own “base URL” setting pointed at `/t/<slug>/`.
